tel 1.0 propensive.dev/bolt

# Bolt codes of Orthant: `subdivision 4` / `error 1` is ↯/o.4.1. A subdivision is a part of what
# Orthant does, in the order `design/engine.md` sets them out; an error takes the next free number
# of its subdivision.
#
# This is the record of the letter `o` which the index of bolt codes, `projects.tel` in
# propensive/bolt, names; its schema is `bolt.tel` there. A code, once assigned, is permanent: a
# number is never reused, and one which is withdrawn stays, marked `retired`.

project o orthant

  subdivision 1
    summary  the store format
    error 1
      summary  a delta file's header is missing or malformed
    error 2
      summary  a line of a delta file has no sigil, or its anchor line is not written as one
    error 3
      summary  the lines of a hunk are out of order, or it has not exactly one anchor line
    error 4
      summary  a delta file is of another format version
    error 5
      summary  the store holds both a base and a delta for a document at a point
    error 6
      summary  a delta's header names an axis which is not its point's storage axis
    error 7
      summary  a directory of the store's data does not name a point
    error 8
      summary  a stored hunk does not have its lines exactly once in its storage parent
    error 9
      summary  the store holds a record at a point whose content is the source's

  subdivision 2
    summary  axes and points
    error 1
      summary  a value is not on the axis
    error 2
      summary  an axis has no root, or more than one
    error 3
      summary  a value's parents form a cycle
    error 4
      summary  a name is not valid for an axis or a value
    error 5
      summary  the axis already exists
    error 6
      summary  an axis of the store already has the value
    error 7
      summary  a value given alone is on more than one axis
    error 8
      summary  no axis has the value, or there is no such axis
    error 9
      summary  hunks are stored on the axis, so what it prefers cannot change

  subdivision 3
    summary  check-in
    error 1
      summary  the checked-out content would not equal the working tree
    error 2
      summary  a point outside the scope would change
    error 3
      summary  a stored hunk would not locate exactly once
    error 4
      summary  a change could not be carried to the point it was sent to
    error 5
      summary  the changes, stored where they were sent, would not give the checked-in content
    error 6
      summary  the check-in is at a point whose content is the source's

  subdivision 4
    summary  the working tree and its views
    error 1
      summary  there is no store in the directory or above it
    error 2
      summary  the working tree has edits which are not checked in
    error 3
      summary  the store's content changed since the document was checked out
    error 4
      summary  a new document's name ends in `.delta`
    error 5
      summary  a file could not be read or written
    error 6
      summary  the document does not exist at the point
    error 7
      summary  a line of a view has no sigil
    error 8
      summary  the reference's lines in a view are not those which were checked out
    error 9
      summary  the `!` lines of a view were changed
    error 10
      summary  the point has no storage parent for an indirect view
    error 11
      summary  a strict export found stale, conflicting or untranslated lines
    error 12
      summary  an update could not carry an edit onto the store's content
    error 13
      summary  there is no view against that change at the point checked out
    error 14
      summary  a view against a change was asked for from the value checked out

  subdivision 5
    summary  the configuration
    error 1
      summary  the configuration, or the record of the view, could not be read, the store is of another format, or a name is there twice
    error 2
      summary  there is already a store in the directory

  subdivision 6
    summary  the command line
    error 1
      summary  unrecognised command
    error 2
      summary  a command was given the wrong operands

  subdivision 7
    summary  git: following a repository, and the source of an axis
    error 1
      summary  the git repository could not be read
    error 2
      summary  a tag has more than one nearest ancestor among the axis's values
    error 3
      summary  the repository has no such branch
    error 4
      summary  the axis does not follow a git repository
    error 5
      summary  the source of an axis could not be read, or none was given
    error 6
      summary  on a sourced axis, a value's commit does not descend from its parent's
    error 7
      summary  the source's repository has no commit which the revision names
    error 8
      summary  the commit does not descend from the root of the sourced axis
    error 9
      summary  the source's history is shallow, and does not reach from the commit to a value
    error 10
      summary  a branch was to be tracked on a sourced axis

  subdivision 8
    summary  upgrading the tool
    error 1
      summary  the launcher did not apply an upgrade which was staged
    error 2
      summary  the executable has no key, so it cannot be upgraded in place
    error 3
      summary  the newest release has no executable for the platform
    error 4
      summary  the release's executable could not be downloaded, or its digest was wrong
    error 5
      summary  the downloaded executable could not be staged
